==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Kaijin Doge]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
*2 [[Miz Devil]]s spawn after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>, delay 2~3.33 seconds<sup>60f~100f</sup>.
*1 [[Devil Wife]] spawns after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*3 [[Malizabeth]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 53.33~60 seconds<sup>1,600f~1,800f</sup>.
*5 [[Devil Wife|Devil Wives]] spawn after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>, delay 60~66.67 seconds<sup>1,800f~2,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Miz Devil]] spawns after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>.
*2 [[Miz Devil]]s spawn after 120 seconds<sup>3,600f</sup>, delay 2~3.33 seconds<sup>60f~100f</sup>.
*8 [[Miz Devil]]s spawn after 160 seconds<sup>4,800f</sup>, delay 23.33~30 seconds<sup>700f~900f</sup>.
*1 [[Archbaron Face]] spawns as the boss after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*1 [[High Countess Koryessa]] spawns after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Kill the first Devil Wife with either [[Talents|Talented]] [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]] or [[Express Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Maglev Cat]] for Extra Cash, then prepare for a long and arduous battle. Boosting [[Scarf Cat (Special Cat)|Red Nyanko Ranger]] is highly recommended.

You'll want to continuously cycle between [[Giga-Nyan Rex (Uber Rare Cat)|Giga-Nyan Prime DX]] and [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] to deal with each Malizabeth, as they are very healthy. Stalling the bosses shouldn't be much of an issue with [[Helmet Cat (Special Cat)|Yellow Nyanko Ranger]] and [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Eraser Cat]] working together to cover each other's bases. In truth, the hardest part of the stage is the cleanup, as Devil Wives and Miz Devils will continuously spawn and usually force you to lose precious space as a result of trying get rid of them. You're going to want to chip Archbaron Face as quickly as possible, since he's usually the one in front blocking you from reaching High Countess Koryessa. [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]] and [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Fishman Cat]] get the job done the fastest; literally, they are fast enough to rush in and deal extreme burst damage. Save Giga-Nyan and Awakened Bahamut Cat for troublesome peons that you may be unable to deal with without sacrificing too much breathing room.

